WEBVTT

01:41.520 --> 01:45.979
[Love of the Divine Tree]

01:46.630 --> 01:48.990
[Episode 15]

01:49.280 --> 01:49.840
Let me ask you.

01:50.400 --> 01:51.200
In the past few days,

01:51.200 --> 01:51.950
have you eaten Madam Wu's buns?

01:52.710 --> 01:53.200
I have.

01:54.870 --> 01:55.710
What connection do you have  who

01:55.810 --> 01:56.970
with those Elite Armored Guard

01:57.000 --> 01:57.759
who have gone missing in the past few days?

01:59.070 --> 01:59.710
Five years ago,

02:00.040 --> 02:00.560
we all served on

02:00.590 --> 02:01.430
a border defence unit

02:02.510 --> 02:03.350
for half a month.

02:04.150 --> 02:04.920
In this unit,

02:05.350 --> 02:05.870
besides you,

02:06.230 --> 02:07.070
how many more are still alive?

02:07.710 --> 02:08.360
There's one more,

02:10.080 --> 02:10.710
Captain Qin.

02:45.560 --> 02:46.190
Alright.

02:46.590 --> 02:48.000
Join them in death!

02:52.750 --> 02:53.280
Activate the formation.

02:53.560 --> 02:54.120
Yes.

03:03.710 --> 03:04.120
Master,

03:04.800 --> 03:05.470
leave it to me.

03:15.630 --> 03:16.920
What's on her is resentment.

03:17.150 --> 03:18.310
Formations against demons wouldn't work.

03:18.560 --> 03:19.630
Switch to one that works on humans.

03:19.910 --> 03:20.910
From Earth and Thunder to Heaven and Fire!

03:40.400 --> 03:41.310
Obliterate all evil,

03:41.630 --> 03:42.630
four Qi condense!

04:12.240 --> 04:12.960
Coal.

04:15.120 --> 04:15.800
Coal.

04:17.000 --> 04:17.630
Coal.

04:19.800 --> 04:20.829
Coal is indeed a demon.

04:21.240 --> 04:22.240
Everything it did

04:22.750 --> 04:23.830
was to save you.

04:24.430 --> 04:26.000
It discovered early on that the fish demon was harming people.

04:26.830 --> 04:27.800
Damaging the compass

04:28.000 --> 04:29.040
was also to lure the Immortal Master

04:29.040 --> 04:29.830
to come and save people.

04:37.240 --> 04:38.070
No matter what,

04:38.830 --> 04:39.430
it protected

04:39.950 --> 04:41.120
the person it wanted to protect the most.

04:45.720 --> 04:46.630
Coal

04:48.480 --> 04:50.070
was like family to me.

04:51.600 --> 04:53.240
Yesterday, when I made you reveal your demon form,

04:57.680 --> 04:58.510
I was really afraid.

05:01.920 --> 05:03.430
I feared you might actually harm people.

05:05.510 --> 05:06.800
But I never thought

05:08.560 --> 05:09.560
you'd be so foolish.

05:14.190 --> 05:15.070
How could you

05:16.630 --> 05:18.360
risk your life for me?

05:36.070 --> 05:37.270
It's a pity

05:38.040 --> 05:39.720
that we're still short two people.

05:41.240 --> 05:42.270
So it is indeed Madam Wu.

05:54.560 --> 05:55.240
Godmother?

05:58.430 --> 05:59.480
Why is it you?

05:59.920 --> 06:01.390
Don't call me godmother anymore.

06:02.190 --> 06:04.160
Did you really think I opened this inn

06:05.070 --> 06:06.160
to look at you all

06:06.190 --> 06:07.190
reminiscing my son?

06:08.110 --> 06:09.040
Let me tell you.

06:09.560 --> 06:10.390
Every time I see

06:10.410 --> 06:11.420
people from your camp,

06:11.510 --> 06:12.750
I have only one thought.

06:13.750 --> 06:14.830
And that is revenge.

06:16.120 --> 06:17.240
I want to avenge

06:17.920 --> 06:18.720
my son!

06:23.750 --> 06:24.480
Godmother,

06:25.830 --> 06:27.750
Brother Wu's death was an accident!

06:28.430 --> 06:29.190
Back then in the Death Zone,

06:29.190 --> 06:30.390
that giant python was too powerful.

06:30.950 --> 06:31.560
Brother Wu died

06:31.560 --> 06:32.040
because he...

06:32.060 --> 06:32.740
Nonsense!

06:34.190 --> 06:35.430
These are all lies made up by

06:35.430 --> 06:36.270
those people

06:36.920 --> 06:38.270
who harmed my son.

06:38.600 --> 06:39.560
How could it be?

06:40.120 --> 06:41.950
They confessed the truth after drinking,

06:42.210 --> 06:43.450
and I heard it with my own ears.

06:43.480 --> 06:44.560
How could it be fake?

06:45.950 --> 06:47.240
My poor son,

06:48.270 --> 06:49.950
he was only fifteen.

06:53.159 --> 06:54.830
Seeing how hard I worked every day,

06:54.850 --> 06:55.530
washing and cooking,

06:55.560 --> 06:56.560
he lied about his age

06:56.870 --> 06:58.430
to join the army at Wangxiang Pass,

06:59.720 --> 07:01.720
just to earn some money

07:02.430 --> 07:04.160
so I wouldn't have to work so hard.

07:06.040 --> 07:07.480
He was still so young.

07:09.240 --> 07:11.040
The armor didn't even fit him properly.

07:11.600 --> 07:13.800
He was so happy when he came back.

07:14.920 --> 07:15.850
He told me

07:16.630 --> 07:18.800
everyone in the camp was kind to him,

07:19.430 --> 07:21.240
and he even gained a few good brothers.

07:24.950 --> 07:26.600
But it was these very brothers

07:27.720 --> 07:28.920
who in the Death Realm

07:29.750 --> 07:31.780
pushed him out to feed the giant python,

07:32.800 --> 07:34.570
stepping on his corpse

07:34.600 --> 07:35.870
to saved their own lives.

07:40.360 --> 07:41.260
Qin Xuanjiu,

07:42.800 --> 07:44.750
although you weren't there that day,

07:46.000 --> 07:47.390
as an officer,

07:47.920 --> 07:49.480
you let my son meet such an unfortunate end.

07:50.480 --> 07:51.950
You deserve to die too!

07:56.070 --> 07:56.920
Don't think that

07:57.530 --> 07:59.090
showing concern for me every day

07:59.120 --> 08:00.240
and calling me godmother

08:00.680 --> 08:02.920
can compensate for my son's life.

08:07.240 --> 08:08.360
My son's remains

08:08.390 --> 08:10.670
are still left alone in the Death Realm.

08:10.690 --> 08:12.450
If you truly see me as your mother,

08:12.630 --> 08:14.680
why don't you bring him back to me?

08:14.700 --> 08:15.720
I've tried,

08:15.950 --> 08:17.430
but that giant python in the Death Realm...

08:22.950 --> 08:24.830
These are all excuses.

08:29.190 --> 08:30.560
None of you

08:31.720 --> 08:33.390
will help me.

08:35.630 --> 08:38.750
Only immortals will lend me their power.

08:42.240 --> 08:43.030
Immortals?

08:43.600 --> 08:44.270
Yes.

08:45.550 --> 08:46.750
They are

08:47.310 --> 08:49.430
real immortals!

08:56.600 --> 08:57.790
All of you

08:58.630 --> 09:02.150
will eventually be killed by the immortals.

09:17.000 --> 09:17.670
Godmother!

09:19.870 --> 09:21.120
Where did this rune come from?

09:25.720 --> 09:27.960
If I can't see my son's remains,

09:29.470 --> 09:31.060
no matter what you ask,

09:32.430 --> 09:33.480
I will not

09:34.270 --> 09:35.120
utter

09:36.390 --> 09:37.750
another word.

09:40.810 --> 09:42.490
Could it be that Spirit Spring used this rune

09:43.320 --> 09:44.870
to transfer resentment onto Madam Wu?

09:46.360 --> 09:48.030
The rune truly is Spirit Spring's tactic.

09:49.120 --> 09:49.790
It's almost dawn.

09:50.390 --> 09:51.750
Let's bring her back to the camp first.

09:52.440 --> 09:53.510
Yes, Master.

09:55.200 --> 09:57.200
Su Yishui indeed didn't disappoint me.

09:58.390 --> 09:59.480
The clue to Spirit Spring

09:59.840 --> 10:00.790
is right before our eyes.

10:02.720 --> 10:04.150
What will happen to Madam Wu next?

10:05.600 --> 10:06.840
After all, lives were lost.

10:07.840 --> 10:08.720
The imperial court

10:09.030 --> 10:10.080
will surely send someone to investigate.

10:10.600 --> 10:11.240
Mr. Qin,

10:12.030 --> 10:12.970
Madam Wu's son

10:13.000 --> 10:14.150
was indeed murdered.

10:14.360 --> 10:16.030
Her desire to revenge made her ill-minded,

10:16.270 --> 10:17.270
and caused her to be possessed by an evil spirit.

10:17.870 --> 10:18.910
We need to investigate further

10:19.200 --> 10:20.440
to find out what kind of evil spirit it is

10:20.670 --> 10:21.600
that could amplify a person's resentment

10:21.630 --> 10:22.670
to such an extent.

10:23.480 --> 10:24.840
I know Madam Wu's personality well.

10:25.670 --> 10:27.320
If we couldn't find Brother Wu's remains,

10:27.670 --> 10:28.720
Madam Wu wouldn't reveal.

10:30.910 --> 10:32.240
But the Death Realm

10:32.860 --> 10:34.190
isn't a place we can simply go as we like.

10:38.150 --> 10:38.600
Break!

10:40.480 --> 10:41.390
What's that?

10:41.910 --> 10:43.080
Just a passing spirit creature.

10:44.840 --> 10:45.390
Master,

10:45.960 --> 10:46.750
is it Wei Jiu?

10:48.870 --> 10:49.840
You seem to recognize him.

10:50.280 --> 10:51.520
The incident at Wangxiang Pass

10:51.980 --> 10:52.940
is related to the root of all evil,

10:53.200 --> 10:54.010
the Spirit Spring.

10:54.150 --> 10:55.030
How do you know this?

10:55.600 --> 10:56.510
Since that time at Mount Absolute,

10:56.790 --> 10:57.980
Wei Jiu has been searching for the Spirit Spring.

10:58.470 --> 10:59.510
His sudden appearance here

10:59.910 --> 11:01.120
must also be for the Spirit Spring.

11:01.360 --> 11:01.870
Master,

11:02.510 --> 11:04.120
as your direct disciple,

11:04.480 --> 11:05.270
I'm willing to carry out your will.

11:05.870 --> 11:06.670
I only allow you to investigate

11:06.670 --> 11:07.480
the case at Wangxiang Pass.

11:08.090 --> 11:09.060
The rest is none of your business.

11:09.600 --> 11:10.440
Master, you see,

11:10.940 --> 11:12.310
Wei Jiu has just seen me.

11:12.460 --> 11:13.690
There's no guarantee he won't target me

11:13.720 --> 11:14.440
to threaten you.

11:14.840 --> 11:15.410
Hence,

11:15.770 --> 11:16.810
it's better for me to stay by your side

11:16.840 --> 11:17.840
and investigate the Spirit Spring together.

11:17.910 --> 11:18.670
That way, I'll be safe.

11:19.390 --> 11:20.870
It's actually simple to prevent Wei Jiu from acting.

11:21.480 --> 11:22.150
You just have to return to Mount Wester

11:22.150 --> 11:23.240
once the case is solved.

11:29.280 --> 11:30.270
Su Yishui,

11:30.790 --> 11:31.600
I must collect

11:31.870 --> 11:32.910
the debt you owe.

11:35.200 --> 11:36.600
The Crown Prince has arrived.

11:38.080 --> 11:40.030
Qin Xuanjiu, guard of Wangxiang Pass,

11:40.360 --> 11:41.630
greets Your Highness.

11:42.200 --> 11:42.840
No need for formalities.

11:46.120 --> 11:47.440
Sovereign Su, why brings you here

11:48.030 --> 11:48.840
to Wangxiang Pass?

11:51.360 --> 11:52.030
Young Master Yu,

11:52.250 --> 11:53.220
we descended the mountain for training

11:53.240 --> 11:54.210
and happened to encounter a demon harming people

11:54.240 --> 11:55.410
at Wangxiang Pass,

11:55.510 --> 11:56.030
so we came over.

11:56.220 --> 11:56.870
That's perfect.

11:57.390 --> 11:58.600
Our last meeting was brief.

11:58.960 --> 12:00.510
Since you're here for training this time,

12:00.840 --> 12:01.790
you might as well accompany me.

12:02.390 --> 12:03.120
My disciple's training

12:03.120 --> 12:04.080
is naturally with me.

12:04.750 --> 12:06.030
It has nothing to do with Your Highness.

12:07.840 --> 12:08.320
Master,

12:09.120 --> 12:10.360
did you just allow me to accompany you?

12:13.720 --> 12:14.480
Captain Qin,

12:15.230 --> 12:16.280
keep the humans under close watch.

12:18.220 --> 12:19.250
Demons are the ones harming humans,

12:20.080 --> 12:21.360
yet you want to keep the humans under watch?

12:22.750 --> 12:23.200
Feng.

12:34.630 --> 12:35.270
Disciple

12:35.720 --> 12:36.670
pays respects to Master.

12:37.350 --> 12:39.870
Captain Qin is Qingge's disciple?

12:40.320 --> 12:40.840
Yes.

12:41.390 --> 12:42.150
You are...

12:42.510 --> 12:43.840
My name is Qin Xuanjiu.

12:44.560 --> 12:45.560
Twenty years ago,

12:46.440 --> 12:47.600
Master saved my life

12:47.630 --> 12:48.440
on the battlefield.

12:48.940 --> 12:49.750
That's how I became your disciple.

12:50.530 --> 12:51.760
After Master's reincarnation,

12:53.390 --> 12:54.910
I have gone to the palace to look for you.

12:56.790 --> 12:58.670
So you’re the one who only memorized the names of immortal arts

12:58.960 --> 12:59.960
but never actually learned them?

13:00.910 --> 13:01.510
Yes.

13:02.320 --> 13:03.720
I had too many disciples in my past life.

13:03.870 --> 13:04.600
I can't remember them all.

13:05.050 --> 13:06.410
Since you haven't learned any immortal arts,

13:06.670 --> 13:07.840
you're not considered my disciple.

13:15.080 --> 13:16.440
He's indeed a half-human, half-demon.

13:16.460 --> 13:17.700
He's the person we're looking for.

13:21.600 --> 13:22.750
Since soldiers in the army are killed,

13:23.200 --> 13:24.360
it is a matter for the imperial court.

13:24.910 --> 13:25.440
Guards!

13:26.120 --> 13:27.840
Take the prisoner back to the capital.

13:28.440 --> 13:28.960
Yes.

13:29.240 --> 13:29.790
Wait.

13:32.870 --> 13:34.030
What is your purpose, Sovereign Su?

13:34.750 --> 13:35.800
Evil spirits causing troubles

13:35.910 --> 13:36.960
have always been handled by the Heavenly Gate.

13:37.360 --> 13:39.080
Such a strange case of a half-human, half-demon

13:39.360 --> 13:40.390
furthermore shouldn't be taken lightly.

13:40.870 --> 13:42.390
Crown Prince, you've overstepped your bounds.

13:42.790 --> 13:44.720
Sovereign Su, you may be domineering on Mount Wester,

13:45.340 --> 13:46.340
but in the military camp,

13:47.220 --> 13:48.370
do you have to be so overbearing too?

13:48.710 --> 13:49.760
The Crown Prince says one word

13:49.790 --> 13:50.600
and the person is being taken away.

13:51.000 --> 13:51.960
Who's more overbearing?

13:54.630 --> 13:55.200
Master,

13:55.440 --> 13:56.000
Young Master Yu,

13:56.390 --> 13:57.200
I have a suggestion.

13:57.630 --> 13:59.080
Madam Wu wasn't originally a demon,

13:59.390 --> 14:00.150
but suddenly became

14:00.150 --> 14:01.320
half-human, half-demon.

14:01.780 --> 14:02.570
The urgent matter at hand

14:02.600 --> 14:04.000
is to find out why this happened.

14:04.690 --> 14:06.180
Since Young Master Yu wants to investigate,

14:06.200 --> 14:07.080
and Master wants to investigate too,

14:07.510 --> 14:09.000
why don't we do it here at Wangxiang Pass?

14:09.030 --> 14:09.790
If we could make this clear,

14:10.200 --> 14:11.510
there's no need to distinguish between

14:11.630 --> 14:12.480
the Heavenly Gate and the imperial court.

14:13.510 --> 14:13.870
Alright.

14:14.240 --> 14:15.270
We'll do as Ranran suggests.

14:15.790 --> 14:16.960
I hope that within a few days,

14:17.750 --> 14:18.670
there can be some progress.

14:22.670 --> 14:23.430
Don't worry, Yu.

14:23.760 --> 14:24.830
With the Exotic Pavilion here,

14:25.600 --> 14:26.480
with Shui here,

14:26.870 --> 14:27.720
and with me here as well,

14:28.320 --> 14:29.750
we'll surely find a way to make her speak.

14:30.270 --> 14:31.200
Master Mu wants to

14:31.560 --> 14:32.130
force a confession?

14:32.960 --> 14:33.870
What's wrong with that?

14:34.510 --> 14:35.550
Didn't she cause deaths?

14:38.540 --> 14:39.580
I beg for Master's mercy.

14:39.910 --> 14:41.480
Madam Wu was possessed by an evil spirit.

14:41.910 --> 14:42.750
It wasn't her intention.

14:44.840 --> 14:46.120
Madam Wu is physically weak.

14:46.790 --> 14:48.030
She can't endure severe torture.

14:48.390 --> 14:49.910
I told you, I'm not your master.

14:50.390 --> 14:51.870
You're pleading for a demon.

14:52.200 --> 14:53.630
Do you want to be charged with harboring a criminal?

14:55.440 --> 14:56.320
Prepare to interrogate the prisoner.

14:56.720 --> 14:57.080
Yes.

15:08.670 --> 15:09.510
She refuses to say anything.

15:11.750 --> 15:12.240
Yu,

15:12.870 --> 15:14.020
you've had a tiring journey today.

15:14.270 --> 15:15.440
Why don't you go back and rest first?

15:16.150 --> 15:17.150
She can't escape anyway.

15:28.360 --> 15:31.310
No one has helped me except the immortals.

15:33.150 --> 15:34.510
If I can't find my child,

15:35.320 --> 15:38.390
I won't say a single word.

15:53.200 --> 15:53.630
Where's Ranran?

15:53.900 --> 15:55.740
She said if you want to know

15:55.760 --> 15:56.550
the origin of the runes,

15:56.840 --> 15:58.000
you need to find

15:58.000 --> 15:59.150
the corpse of Madam Wu's son.

15:59.600 --> 16:00.910
She also asked me to tell you

16:03.940 --> 16:04.780
not to worry.

16:04.910 --> 16:06.030
"I'm very powerful now.

16:06.420 --> 16:06.940
I definitely won't

16:06.960 --> 16:08.130
lose to a snake."

16:13.390 --> 16:14.840
Fifty li southwest from here

16:16.150 --> 16:16.960
is the Death Realm!

16:17.550 --> 16:19.090
[Death Realm]

16:39.840 --> 16:40.960
The armored skeletons

16:41.960 --> 16:42.840
is in this direction.

17:12.970 --> 17:14.200
[Wu Dayou]

17:15.880 --> 17:16.780
On behalf of your mother,

17:16.829 --> 17:17.630
I'm bringing you home.

17:54.400 --> 17:55.440
Watch me shatter your demon core!

17:56.790 --> 17:57.450
Ranran.

18:00.750 --> 18:01.440
Xue Ranran.

18:08.830 --> 18:09.480
Ranran.

18:10.920 --> 18:11.510
Master.

18:12.960 --> 18:13.510
Master.

18:14.590 --> 18:15.070
Master,

18:23.550 --> 18:25.400
that demon just now was quite formidable.

18:25.590 --> 18:26.790
It almost swallowed me whole.

18:27.250 --> 18:27.920
But I thought,

18:28.010 --> 18:29.210
since it was a skeletal python

18:29.240 --> 18:29.920
and had no flesh,

18:30.170 --> 18:31.500
what could it do even if it swallowed me?

18:31.790 --> 18:32.150
So,

18:32.270 --> 18:33.750
I simply crawled into its belly,

18:33.840 --> 18:34.930
trailed its bone crevices,

18:34.960 --> 18:36.070
and pierced its demon core.

18:41.550 --> 18:42.030
Master,

18:43.110 --> 18:43.880
I have made a mistake.

18:44.880 --> 18:45.750
You're quick to admit your mistake,

18:46.440 --> 18:47.200
but you never learn.

18:49.430 --> 18:50.310
I know that

18:50.310 --> 18:51.510
Master doesn't allow me to act like this.

18:51.960 --> 18:53.110
But if I could choose again,

18:53.480 --> 18:54.480
I would do the same thing.

18:55.860 --> 18:56.340
What?

18:57.390 --> 18:58.760
A immortal cultivator draws their essence

18:58.790 --> 18:59.640
from the universe

18:59.830 --> 19:00.920
and should be returned it in kind.

19:01.280 --> 19:02.970
Upholding justice and rescuing the weak i

19:03.000 --> 19:03.970
is the cycle of the Heavenly Way.

19:04.480 --> 19:05.510
Although Madam Wu has harmed people,

19:05.960 --> 19:07.480
her child is the most innocent.

19:08.330 --> 19:09.370
If he saw his mother

19:09.400 --> 19:09.960
in this state,

19:10.070 --> 19:10.880
he would surely be heartbroken.

19:11.270 --> 19:12.550
So I brought back his remains,

19:13.070 --> 19:14.110
firstly to find clues,

19:14.480 --> 19:15.160
and secondly,

19:15.160 --> 19:16.200
to fulfill this unfulfilled wish.

19:17.400 --> 19:18.270
There are countless people

19:18.330 --> 19:19.810
in this universe who need help.

19:20.720 --> 19:22.250
These small acts of kindness

19:22.550 --> 19:23.310
are meaningless.

19:24.350 --> 19:25.830
I'll just help as many people as I can.

19:26.110 --> 19:27.240
It's better than doing nothing at all.

19:27.910 --> 19:29.470
If we calculate gains and losses like this,

19:29.750 --> 19:30.650
then what's the point

19:30.680 --> 19:31.480
of immortal cultivation training?

19:31.880 --> 19:32.350
Am I right?

19:32.680 --> 19:33.110
Yes.

19:40.880 --> 19:41.500
Um,

19:41.960 --> 19:42.480
Master,

19:43.210 --> 19:44.370
I just

19:44.400 --> 19:45.440
thought of some principles

19:45.460 --> 19:46.780
and wanted to discuss them with you.

19:50.590 --> 19:52.400
This Spirit Dispelling Formation didn't work either.

19:53.880 --> 19:55.400
Master, why are you being so polite?

19:56.920 --> 19:58.590
Next time when you discuss principles with me,

19:59.110 --> 20:00.200
your tone mustn't be disrespectful.

20:01.410 --> 20:01.910
Yes.

20:07.950 --> 20:08.620
Let me ask you one last thing.

20:09.350 --> 20:10.510
In the future, if you encounter such

20:10.680 --> 20:12.070
situations where you have to save people from danger,

20:12.610 --> 20:13.770
but it's extremely perilous,

20:14.400 --> 20:15.160
what should you do?

20:15.510 --> 20:16.610
Call Xi'er and the others to help.

20:16.640 --> 20:17.070
Wrong.

20:25.030 --> 20:26.830
Is it so hard to call for your master's help?

20:31.030 --> 20:31.880
I get it now, Master.

20:44.950 --> 20:45.720
I still couldn't get any information

20:45.720 --> 20:46.510
about the origin of that rune.

20:47.160 --> 20:47.920
That demonic lady

20:48.270 --> 20:49.240
still refuses to talk.

20:49.640 --> 20:50.680
But don't worry, Your Highness.

20:51.160 --> 20:52.440
The information you want to know,

20:52.790 --> 20:53.440
I

20:53.590 --> 20:55.270
will definitely find a way to get it for you.

20:56.790 --> 20:58.070
So Yu really wants to know

20:58.070 --> 20:59.550
about that rune.

21:12.920 --> 21:14.750
Whatever punishment you have,

21:16.270 --> 21:17.480
just use it all.

21:18.200 --> 21:19.720
Best if you could just kill me,

21:20.240 --> 21:22.550
so I can meet see my son.

21:22.790 --> 21:23.640
There's no rush.

21:24.000 --> 21:25.830
I haven't heard what I want to hear yet.

21:26.400 --> 21:28.110
How could I let you die so easily?

21:32.310 --> 21:33.160
What is this?

21:36.710 --> 21:38.000
Why can't I

21:38.070 --> 21:39.030
control my body anymore?

21:40.080 --> 21:41.050
This is called

21:41.070 --> 21:42.150
a Marrow-Eating Roach.

21:42.550 --> 21:43.960
It loves to burrow into and devour fish brains.

21:45.680 --> 21:48.160
I heard you're half-human

21:48.480 --> 21:49.480
and half-fish.

21:52.160 --> 21:53.440
You're indeed afraid of it.

21:54.240 --> 21:55.200
Take it away!

21:55.650 --> 21:56.890
Take it away quickly!

21:56.920 --> 21:57.550
Sure.

21:58.280 --> 21:59.240
Tell me about the origin

21:59.270 --> 22:00.240
of the rune on you,

22:00.590 --> 22:01.590
and I'll take it away.

22:04.270 --> 22:06.070
Just kill me.

22:06.680 --> 22:08.070
Seems like you're still not scared enough.

22:09.030 --> 22:10.480
Then let's have a taste of it

22:10.580 --> 22:11.400
before we talk.

22:23.000 --> 22:24.300
When you can't bear it anymore,

22:24.330 --> 22:25.170
remember to call for me.

22:33.750 --> 22:34.910
Still not talking?

22:56.210 --> 22:57.080
You filthy thing。

22:57.110 --> 22:57.680
You're asking for death!

23:07.440 --> 23:08.270
Qingge, what are you doing?

23:08.790 --> 23:09.340
Yu,

23:09.790 --> 23:10.880
I just wanted to help you

23:10.880 --> 23:11.880
to question this demon.

23:12.400 --> 23:13.030
Who knew

23:13.200 --> 23:14.000
she would suddenly go berserk

23:14.000 --> 23:15.000
and try to kill me?

23:18.240 --> 23:19.000
You're hurt.

23:20.400 --> 23:21.310
It's just a minor injury.

23:22.960 --> 23:23.920
Then we need to treat it quickly.

23:38.590 --> 23:39.550
Something's not right.

23:40.200 --> 23:41.960
Why are we still going in circles after so long?

23:43.750 --> 23:45.030
Try using your spiritual power.

23:51.990 --> 23:52.860
I can't use my spiritual power.

23:54.070 --> 23:54.830
Why is this happening?

23:57.310 --> 23:58.240
The Death Realm

23:58.680 --> 23:59.350
has changed.

24:05.270 --> 24:06.480
What's going on?

24:08.270 --> 24:09.510
Countless beings have perished

24:09.740 --> 24:10.920
in the Death Realm over the centuries.

24:11.790 --> 24:12.680
It was the

24:12.680 --> 24:13.830
giant Bone Python

24:14.110 --> 24:14.790
who kept things in balanced.

24:15.460 --> 24:16.460
But now that the Bone Python is dead,

24:17.030 --> 24:18.160
all the death energy has been released,

24:18.400 --> 24:19.200
saturating the air,

24:19.550 --> 24:20.270
and obstructing spiritual power.

24:22.590 --> 24:23.510
What should we do then?

24:24.790 --> 24:25.310
How about

24:25.980 --> 24:27.460
one of us will take in the new,

24:27.600 --> 24:28.360
while the other expels the impurities.

24:28.790 --> 24:29.860
If we alternate like this,

24:30.000 --> 24:31.030
we'll be able to use our spiritual power

24:31.160 --> 24:31.790
to leave this place.

24:32.500 --> 24:33.310
So we need to...

24:36.080 --> 24:36.680
Hold onto this.

24:40.510 --> 24:41.830
Seems like Master also thinks

24:42.000 --> 24:42.860
I'm doing the right thing.

24:43.330 --> 24:44.700
Otherwise, why would you let me hold your hand?

24:45.200 --> 24:45.790
I'm asking you to...

24:54.750 --> 24:55.200
Forget it.

24:58.690 --> 24:59.460
Master,

25:00.110 --> 25:01.030
you're blushing.

25:02.550 --> 25:03.200
Focus.

25:28.180 --> 25:28.830
Master.

25:30.750 --> 25:31.240
What's wrong?

25:31.920 --> 25:33.110
Madam Wu is missing.

25:36.480 --> 25:37.000
Ranran,

25:38.440 --> 25:39.510
Madam Wu has died.

25:41.030 --> 25:41.750
How could this be?

25:43.100 --> 25:44.580
Master interrogated her personally.

25:48.960 --> 25:49.640
I'm not sure why.

25:49.960 --> 25:51.480
It was Madam Wu who went mad suddenly.

25:54.510 --> 25:55.620
Qingge killed her

25:56.480 --> 25:57.160
under self-defence.

25:58.350 --> 25:59.440
Madam Wu was determined to die

25:59.920 --> 26:01.080
but was firmly locked up.

26:01.490 --> 26:02.070
How could she have

26:02.100 --> 26:03.260
suddenly gone berserk?

26:04.030 --> 26:04.680
Young Master Yu,

26:05.000 --> 26:05.720
where is Master Mu?

26:06.070 --> 26:06.830
I need to get to the bottom of this.

26:07.030 --> 26:08.090
Qingge was injured by her

26:08.510 --> 26:09.350
and is now recovering.

26:10.240 --> 26:11.110
Let's not disturb her.

26:12.770 --> 26:13.690
We went through great trouble

26:13.720 --> 26:14.720
to retrieve her son's remains;

26:15.400 --> 26:16.750
we need answers from her.

26:17.960 --> 26:18.400
Besides,

26:19.200 --> 26:20.720
even if Madam Wu was guilty and deserved punishment,

26:21.110 --> 26:21.750
it should be done through either a public trial,

26:21.750 --> 26:22.920
or the Heavenly order.

26:23.270 --> 26:24.790
How could Master Mu just kill her without due process?

26:25.680 --> 26:26.110
Ranran,

26:27.200 --> 26:28.240
It’s come to this,

26:28.830 --> 26:29.550
there’s nothing more that can be done.

26:30.600 --> 26:31.890
Besides, when the Heavenly Sects

26:31.920 --> 26:33.240
typically encounters a demon like Madam Wu,

26:34.000 --> 26:34.880
they would have killed her long ago,

26:35.960 --> 26:36.480
wouldn't they?

26:37.200 --> 26:38.810
It was a case where

26:38.920 --> 26:39.920
pleas for karma went unanswered,

26:40.710 --> 26:42.380
that's why Madam Wu sought help from evil spirits,

26:42.750 --> 26:43.880
leading to this disaster.

26:46.110 --> 26:46.920
Now,

26:47.750 --> 26:49.200
it's still the same.

26:53.070 --> 26:53.510
Ranran,

26:54.960 --> 26:56.160
I'll allocate a piece of land with good feng shui

26:56.880 --> 26:58.030
for the mother and son to be buried together.

26:58.820 --> 27:00.030
This should put your mind at ease.

27:01.110 --> 27:01.720
Is that alright?

27:03.070 --> 27:03.960
Thank you, Your Highness.

27:10.030 --> 27:11.270
Acted in self-defence?

27:19.120 --> 27:19.750
All packed up?

27:19.800 --> 27:20.440
Let's leave.

27:22.110 --> 27:22.750
Don't stay here anymore.

27:22.770 --> 27:23.480
Let's get out.

27:23.610 --> 27:24.990
I heard the owner of this inn

27:25.010 --> 27:25.790
killed someone

27:25.880 --> 27:26.750
and was sentenced to death.

27:26.930 --> 27:27.680
It's very unlucky.

27:27.970 --> 27:28.510
Let's leave.

27:28.530 --> 27:28.960
Go.

27:29.030 --> 27:29.640
Go, go, go.

27:29.720 --> 27:30.350
Hurry.

27:31.680 --> 27:32.590
Years of operation

27:33.190 --> 27:35.060
can fall into ruin in an instant.

27:36.920 --> 27:38.200
Where will we stay for the next few days?

27:38.640 --> 27:39.690
There simply is no one here to manage.

27:40.000 --> 27:40.640
For us,

27:41.110 --> 27:41.750
it makes no difference.

27:45.830 --> 27:47.160
What Master means is

27:47.400 --> 27:48.840
that we've all eaten poisoned buns

27:49.030 --> 27:49.750
and couldn't fly on our swords,

27:50.360 --> 27:51.640
so we should rest here for a few days

27:51.660 --> 27:52.380
before we can set out.

27:55.920 --> 27:56.350
Let's go.

28:22.160 --> 28:22.830
Master.

28:23.310 --> 28:24.160
You have accumulated merits

28:24.590 --> 28:26.160
and your cultivation has reached the stage of Qi Refinement.

28:26.640 --> 28:27.640
You will soon be ready to build Foundation.

28:28.920 --> 28:29.440
What's wrong?

28:30.720 --> 28:31.070
I

28:32.510 --> 28:33.550
think I know

28:33.550 --> 28:34.790
what the runes on Madam Wu are.

28:35.640 --> 28:36.510
How did you find out?

28:37.240 --> 28:38.400
I saw through Vine again

28:38.930 --> 28:40.560
and had a glimpse of fragments of my past life.

28:40.920 --> 28:41.920
I saw a book

28:42.480 --> 28:43.440
and the runes on it

28:43.550 --> 28:45.070
were identical to those on Madam Wu's body.

28:46.030 --> 28:47.550
It's called the Seven Evil Transformation Spell.

28:48.880 --> 28:49.480
Can't believe I have forgotten

28:49.480 --> 28:50.640
these information from back then.

28:52.680 --> 28:53.950
Seven Evil Transformation Spell.

28:54.750 --> 28:55.640
Celestial Sect.

28:58.830 --> 28:59.750
I see.

29:00.310 --> 29:01.440
What exactly is going on,

29:01.920 --> 29:02.480
Master?

29:03.030 --> 29:04.270
I've heard that Seven Evil Transformation Spell

29:04.510 --> 29:05.350
is powered by resentment

29:05.790 --> 29:07.070
to integrate humans and beasts into demons.

29:07.790 --> 29:08.510
And the resentment generated

29:08.510 --> 29:09.480
by these demons

29:09.860 --> 29:10.860
can be absorbed back by the spell,

29:11.160 --> 29:12.070
creating an endless cycle.

29:12.680 --> 29:13.720
The Mortal-Demon Lord back then

29:13.740 --> 29:14.870
relied on this evil spell

29:15.510 --> 29:16.640
to accumulate resentment and become a devil,

29:17.030 --> 29:18.200
eventually becoming the leader of all devils.

29:19.010 --> 29:20.450
The Spirit Spring is the Mortal-Demon Lord's

29:20.480 --> 29:21.400
spiritual power transformed.

29:22.000 --> 29:22.640
So,

29:23.550 --> 29:24.790
this is a repeat of the old trick.

29:25.550 --> 29:26.030
Correct.

29:26.680 --> 29:28.070
The Spirit Spring intended to do the same as before,

29:28.370 --> 29:29.250
accumulating resentment

29:29.480 --> 29:30.310
to break the seal.

29:31.000 --> 29:32.000
What should we do then?

29:32.550 --> 29:33.720
Since it's still harming people,

29:34.070 --> 29:35.200
it means the seal hasn't been broken yet.

29:35.640 --> 29:36.560
We still stand a chance.

29:36.920 --> 29:37.640
I know someone

29:38.000 --> 29:39.200
who should be able to use the spell

29:39.440 --> 29:40.400
to locate the Spirit Spring.

29:41.830 --> 29:42.240
Alright,

29:42.790 --> 29:43.960
none of this matters right now.

29:44.270 --> 29:45.160
You've just advanced.

29:45.450 --> 29:46.540
Quickly focus and stabilize your spiritual power.

29:47.000 --> 29:47.590
I'll help you.

30:03.110 --> 30:04.830
Why have these ice walls melted?

30:06.070 --> 30:07.070
My cultivation has advanced.

30:07.110 --> 30:08.070
I can come to see you again.

30:08.350 --> 30:09.200
How have you been lately?

30:09.820 --> 30:10.670
It seems that

30:10.700 --> 30:12.050
it has become much warmer here.

30:12.240 --> 30:13.550
Has it become easier to endure now?

30:18.270 --> 30:19.000
You don't know,

30:19.310 --> 30:20.900
so many things have happened recently.

30:21.330 --> 30:22.570
I like Master

30:23.010 --> 30:24.400
and It seems he found out.

30:25.100 --> 30:26.790
I thought he wouldn't talk to me anymore,

30:27.110 --> 30:27.920
but guess what,

30:28.110 --> 30:29.440
he is still be so kind to me.

30:33.920 --> 30:34.600
Yesterday,

30:35.040 --> 30:37.040
Master played the flute to help me out of a difficult situation.

30:37.880 --> 30:39.640
He protected me, afraid I might get hurt.

30:40.720 --> 30:42.030
When I went to the Death Realm,

30:42.340 --> 30:44.130
he got very angry

30:44.160 --> 30:45.070
and was very worried about me.

30:46.240 --> 30:46.960
Do you think

30:48.600 --> 30:49.520
Master might

30:49.550 --> 30:50.720
have feelings for me too?

30:54.960 --> 30:55.830
If that's the case,

30:56.410 --> 30:57.040
if I invite Master again

30:57.070 --> 30:58.510
to see the Paired Wings Auspicious Clouds,

30:58.750 --> 31:00.290
he would agree, right?

31:11.720 --> 31:13.440
When we left the Death Realm today,

31:13.680 --> 31:15.480
Master asked me to hold his hand.

31:16.510 --> 31:18.110
Master's hand was really soft.

31:18.540 --> 31:19.350
Oh, right!

31:19.790 --> 31:20.550
Master's hand

31:20.790 --> 31:21.790
is on my back right now,

31:21.790 --> 31:22.610
helping me cultivate.

31:22.830 --> 31:24.070
I never dared to imagine this!

31:25.720 --> 31:27.350
if only I could be under

31:27.370 --> 31:28.170
the Peach Blossom Intoxication again.

31:28.830 --> 31:30.400
The duration last time was too short,

31:30.680 --> 31:32.030
there wasn't enough time to do many things.

31:32.680 --> 31:34.200
I wanted to pinch Master's cheeks,

31:34.480 --> 31:35.480
but there wasn't time for that.

31:37.070 --> 31:38.750
Would  Master's cheek

31:39.000 --> 31:40.350
be as soft as his hand?

31:50.640 --> 31:51.830
Where is Master?

31:52.670 --> 31:54.060
Why did he suddenly leave?

32:07.880 --> 32:08.680
You are...

32:10.310 --> 32:11.150
May I ask, young lady,

32:11.640 --> 32:13.240
was the person with you earlier

32:13.270 --> 32:14.890
really the sovereign of Mount Wester,

32:14.910 --> 32:15.910
Su Yishui?

32:16.480 --> 32:16.880
Yes.

32:17.200 --> 32:18.110
Are you looking for Master?

32:20.550 --> 32:21.780
I indeed have some business

32:21.810 --> 32:23.060
and need to see Sovereign Su.

32:23.310 --> 32:23.960
Please wait a moment.

32:27.590 --> 32:28.220
Master.

32:28.520 --> 32:29.140
I'm not around.

32:35.400 --> 32:36.000
Um,

32:36.420 --> 32:37.710
someone is here to see you.

32:38.780 --> 32:39.190
Come in.

32:48.240 --> 32:49.480
We don't seem to know each other.

32:49.920 --> 32:52.440
Although Sovereign Su doesn't recognize me,

32:52.830 --> 32:53.960
for the past ten years,

32:54.030 --> 32:55.550
I've been to Mount Wester many times.

32:56.520 --> 32:57.150
Unfortunately,

32:57.300 --> 32:58.890
the gates were always closed

32:59.070 --> 33:00.030
and I never had the chance to meet you.

33:00.720 --> 33:01.270
Today,

33:01.550 --> 33:03.720
running into Sovereign Su at Wangxiang Pass

33:04.270 --> 33:06.070
must be heaven's will.

33:07.750 --> 33:09.160
I've been entrusted by an old friend

33:09.640 --> 33:12.070
to bring something to Sovereign Su.

33:13.270 --> 33:14.920
I've long since cut ties with the mortal world

33:15.230 --> 33:16.470
and I don't accept things from others.

33:16.920 --> 33:18.550
This old friend of mine is not a stranger.

33:19.270 --> 33:20.000
Her surname is Jiang,

33:20.590 --> 33:21.680
and she's Sovereign Su's

33:21.960 --> 33:24.030
inseparable blood relative.

33:27.400 --> 33:28.480
Many years ago,

33:29.120 --> 33:30.810
I once held you

33:30.830 --> 33:31.430
at the Rouge Chamber

33:33.070 --> 33:34.680
This old friend of mine is

33:35.240 --> 33:36.350
your mother.

33:38.270 --> 33:39.100
Sister Jiang

33:39.340 --> 33:41.260
died of illness at Wangxiang Pass.

33:41.830 --> 33:43.000
Before she passed away,

33:44.240 --> 33:46.110
she mustered all her strength

33:47.240 --> 33:48.830
to ask me to pass you this key.

33:49.680 --> 33:50.890
She said you have to

33:50.920 --> 33:52.350
visit her final accommodation.

33:53.440 --> 33:53.830
There's no need.

33:54.440 --> 33:55.110
Ranran, see the guest out.

33:55.640 --> 33:56.350
Yishui,

33:57.160 --> 33:59.000
I know her personality well.

33:59.720 --> 34:00.760
What happened to you back then

34:00.790 --> 34:02.110
doesn't seem like something she would do.

34:02.720 --> 34:03.350
After she passed away,

34:03.370 --> 34:04.640
I often came to pay my respects.

34:04.960 --> 34:05.590
Yesterday

34:06.540 --> 34:08.310
happened to be the anniversary of her death.

34:10.150 --> 34:10.880
I'm not forcing you

34:10.900 --> 34:12.420
to acknowledge this family tie again,

34:12.449 --> 34:12.969
Yishui.

34:13.440 --> 34:14.000
At least

34:14.630 --> 34:16.320
take this key and pay a visit

34:16.340 --> 34:17.460
to fulfill her last wish.

34:18.550 --> 34:19.030
Ranran,

34:20.850 --> 34:21.600
see the guest out.

34:26.590 --> 34:27.150
Madam.

34:28.350 --> 34:29.909
I once heard Madam Wu

34:29.940 --> 34:31.650
mumbling when drunk,

34:32.110 --> 34:33.400
if she could start over,

34:34.360 --> 34:36.590
she wouldn't let her son join the army.

34:37.920 --> 34:40.320
The world is full of accidents and misfortunes.

34:41.000 --> 34:42.000
If you're not careful,

34:43.320 --> 34:45.000
you might regret it for life.

34:49.320 --> 34:50.110
This key,

34:50.590 --> 34:51.400
I'll leave it here.

34:52.400 --> 34:53.110
As for

34:54.280 --> 34:55.030
whether you go

34:55.960 --> 34:56.880
or not...

35:11.230 --> 35:12.000
Master!

35:30.710 --> 35:32.670
Master actually does care a lot, doesn't he?

35:33.670 --> 35:35.440
I better piece the key back together

35:35.700 --> 35:37.180
and ask about the location of the grave.

35:38.010 --> 35:38.810
If someday

35:38.840 --> 35:39.880
Master changes his mind,

35:40.440 --> 35:41.760
at least he'll know where to find it.

35:43.130 --> 35:46.840
[Madam Wu's Inn]

35:56.030 --> 35:56.480
Show it to me.

36:02.250 --> 36:03.550
You're becoming more and more disobedient.

36:06.480 --> 36:07.230
You spent the entire night

36:07.810 --> 36:08.680
searching for these fragments

36:08.710 --> 36:09.510
piece by piece

36:09.760 --> 36:10.480
in the river?

36:11.030 --> 36:11.510
Yes.

36:12.150 --> 36:12.960
Your cultivation is still unstable,

36:13.450 --> 36:14.450
yet you waste your energy

36:14.480 --> 36:15.070
on these trivial matters.

36:15.320 --> 36:16.320
Throw them away immediately and go back to meditate.

36:16.710 --> 36:17.070
No.

36:21.480 --> 36:22.400
You want to be punished?

36:22.710 --> 36:23.670
Even if I'm punished,

36:23.840 --> 36:24.920
I can't throw away this key.

36:26.480 --> 36:27.110
The lady said

36:27.390 --> 36:28.910
the world is full of accidents and misfortunes.

36:29.880 --> 36:31.030
I'm afraid she might be right.

36:32.590 --> 36:33.800
You're getting bolder and bolder.

36:34.270 --> 36:34.920
You dare to start meddling

36:34.920 --> 36:35.800
in my personal affairs?

36:36.510 --> 36:37.230
I wouldn't dare, Master.

36:40.140 --> 36:41.870
I'm just afraid to see you upset.

36:42.590 --> 36:43.230
Today, when Master

36:43.230 --> 36:44.440
threw away the key,

36:45.150 --> 36:46.510
you were actually quite upset, weren't you?

36:49.590 --> 36:50.590
Do you really know

36:51.400 --> 36:52.190
if I’m upset?

36:53.110 --> 36:54.230
Everything about you, Master,

36:54.800 --> 36:56.000
I care deeply about.

36:57.000 --> 36:58.600
I don't know what happened in the past,

36:59.760 --> 37:01.070
I'm just concerned

37:01.840 --> 37:02.880
that If there are any regrets,

37:03.320 --> 37:05.030
there should be a chance to clarify things.

37:07.940 --> 37:09.000
Regrets are regrets.

37:10.510 --> 37:11.590
We didn’t meet while alive,

37:12.510 --> 37:13.800
so why should there be any ties after death?"

37:16.070 --> 37:16.630
Forget it.

37:17.390 --> 37:18.310
Since you've found it,

37:18.880 --> 37:20.150
just return the key to the house.

37:20.960 --> 37:22.440
Master, are you really not going?

37:22.830 --> 37:24.140
Are you thinking of forcing me with the spirit Dispelling Formation again?

37:25.630 --> 37:26.960
This is your personal matter, Master.

37:27.110 --> 37:27.570
I

37:31.150 --> 37:32.070
wouldn't dare to.

37:59.150 --> 37:59.880
Madam Jiang.

38:00.770 --> 38:01.810
I'm returning the key

38:01.840 --> 38:02.590
on behalf of Master.

38:14.400 --> 38:15.960
Why does it feel so cold

38:16.110 --> 38:17.480
whenever I get close to this box?

38:22.840 --> 38:24.440
Madam Jiang died of illness.

38:24.760 --> 38:25.800
Judging from the handwriting,

38:25.960 --> 38:26.550
she must have used

38:26.550 --> 38:27.840
her last ounce of strength to write.

38:28.960 --> 38:30.960
She begged someone to bring the key to Master,

38:31.040 --> 38:32.460
[To Shui]

38:31.230 --> 38:32.070
but not

38:32.070 --> 38:33.280
the letter and box directly.

38:33.680 --> 38:34.630
There must be a hidden story.

38:37.000 --> 38:37.440
No.

38:37.880 --> 38:38.670
I still need to ask Master

38:38.670 --> 38:39.400
to come and see for himself.

38:40.920 --> 38:41.880
But forcing Master

38:41.880 --> 38:43.000
is really inappropriate.

38:44.000 --> 38:44.480
I've got it.

38:46.800 --> 38:47.590
Master, save me!

38:57.290 --> 38:58.330
I told you to shout "Master, save me!"

38:58.360 --> 38:59.030
for your own protection.

38:59.280 --> 39:00.320
How dare you use it to trick me.

39:01.190 --> 39:02.110
I know it's not right.

39:02.510 --> 39:03.440
Take a look at this box.

39:24.760 --> 39:25.360
Master,

39:26.510 --> 39:28.240
this porcelain bottle is bone-chillingly cold.

39:29.250 --> 39:30.770
Madam Jiang has no immortal powers.

39:31.150 --> 39:32.030
Carrying this thing

39:32.360 --> 39:33.480
would surely cause her to be plagued by severe illness.

39:34.280 --> 39:35.550
Perhaps this is why

39:38.670 --> 39:40.190
she called you here to take a look.

39:40.930 --> 39:41.560
She must have

39:41.590 --> 39:42.630
left some important words.

39:57.480 --> 39:58.280
Shui,

40:00.130 --> 40:01.640
as I write this first sentence,

40:01.670 --> 40:02.590
I'm already thinking

40:03.910 --> 40:04.830
that you probably

40:05.360 --> 40:06.840
will never see this letter.

40:08.190 --> 40:09.320
But I have no choice.

40:10.150 --> 40:11.440
I can only take a gamble,

40:12.320 --> 40:13.710
betting that I can use my life

40:14.450 --> 40:15.370
to free my dear Shui

40:15.390 --> 40:16.780
from the torment of evil magic.

40:17.770 --> 40:19.160
Because this is the sin

40:19.190 --> 40:20.320
I committed out of presumption.

40:22.400 --> 40:24.000
Before Prince Ping took you away,

40:24.000 --> 40:24.840
he came to me.

40:25.720 --> 40:27.150
He said he'd give me a sum of money

40:27.320 --> 40:28.840
to let you be a young master in his mansion.

40:30.550 --> 40:32.110
Of course I wanted the money,

40:33.440 --> 40:35.840
but I also wanted you to live a life better than mine.

40:38.070 --> 40:39.280
He feared you wouldn't comply,

40:39.710 --> 40:41.190
so he wanted me to cut off your hopes.

40:41.920 --> 40:43.030
That is why, from that time on,

40:44.320 --> 40:45.480
I became cold towards you

40:47.360 --> 40:48.280
and harsh on you.

40:49.710 --> 40:51.090
I listened to your father's words

40:51.280 --> 40:52.800
and must never recognize you.

40:54.360 --> 40:55.480
Until his military defeat,

40:56.770 --> 40:58.020
I was very worried about you,

40:58.480 --> 41:00.590
but I overheard his conversation with his subordinates.

41:03.550 --> 41:05.440
Three provinces have been lost in succession.

41:05.710 --> 41:06.800
What are Your Highness's

41:07.030 --> 41:07.920
next plans?

41:08.080 --> 41:08.890
What plans?

41:08.920 --> 41:09.920
You're all a bunch of useless fools.

41:10.440 --> 41:10.920
Get out!

41:12.230 --> 41:12.760
Yes.

41:26.150 --> 41:27.230
Su Yishui,

41:28.920 --> 41:32.150
if you little brat still refuse to summon the Spirit Spring

41:33.630 --> 41:36.230
and insist on saving some Mu Qingge...

41:38.670 --> 41:39.480
Fine,

41:41.000 --> 41:42.190
it doesn't matter.

41:42.880 --> 41:44.590
As long as I have this in hand,

41:45.840 --> 41:46.930
I can certainly make you

41:46.960 --> 41:49.070
be my killing blade again.

41:50.520 --> 41:51.410
Only then did I realize

41:51.440 --> 41:52.320
that he took you away

41:52.440 --> 41:54.190
solely to make you his killing puppet.

41:54.960 --> 41:56.230
Only then did I know how much suffering

41:56.250 --> 41:57.710
you've endured all these years.

42:00.550 --> 42:02.150
Fire! Fire!

42:02.170 --> 42:02.900
There's a fire!

42:03.510 --> 42:04.440
Quick, put out the fire!

42:04.510 --> 42:04.960
Hurry!

42:05.150 --> 42:06.000
Quick, put out the fire!

42:06.800 --> 42:07.710
There's a fire!

42:08.590 --> 42:08.920
Fire!

42:08.920 --> 42:09.230
Fire!

42:09.230 --> 42:09.710
Come!

42:09.880 --> 42:10.710
There's a fire!

42:10.960 --> 42:11.710
Quick, put out the fire!

42:11.800 --> 42:12.400
Hurry up!

42:15.840 --> 42:16.440
That night,

42:17.160 --> 42:18.160
I stole the porcelain bottle

42:18.190 --> 42:19.280
and escaped to Wangxiang Pass.

42:20.080 --> 42:20.730
My only thought was

42:20.760 --> 42:22.030
that if I gave you this bottle,

42:22.760 --> 42:24.710
you would no longer be at anyone's mercy.

42:35.030 --> 42:35.880
But who would have known,

42:36.600 --> 42:38.190
I fell ill and never recovered?

42:49.110 --> 42:50.760
When you were just born,

42:53.410 --> 42:54.890
I always felt that we, mother and son,

42:55.440 --> 42:56.960
would have a whole lifetime together.

43:09.160 --> 43:10.330
Who knew that the good days of one's life

43:10.360 --> 43:11.320
are limited?

43:12.920 --> 43:14.360
In the blink of an eye,

43:15.410 --> 43:16.680
only scattered memories

43:16.710 --> 43:17.630
are left to savour.

43:18.710 --> 43:20.440
I'm sorry for failing you in this lifetime, my child.

43:22.590 --> 43:23.760
If there's a next life,

43:24.960 --> 43:26.630
Mom will make it up to you properly.
